<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
    <style>
        .content{
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 0px 20px;
        }
        .founders{
            width: 25vw;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .founders img{
            width: 200px;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .founders legend{
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .social i{
            font-size: 30px;
            color: black;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .dark-mode .social i{
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body id="light-mode">
    <!-- navbar -->
    <div id="main"></div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="container2">
            <div class="navbar">
                <div id="logo"><img src="/logo.png"></div>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/users/<%= user._id %>">HOME</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/history">HISTORY</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/leaderboard">LEADERBOARD</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/resources">RESOURCES</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/premium">PREMIUM</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/contactus">CONTACT US</a>
                <a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/aboutus">ABOUT US</a>
            </div>
            <!-- cards -->
            <div class="content">
                <div id="ayushman" class="founders">
                    <fieldset>
                        <legend><b>Ayushman Singh</b></legend>
                        <img src="http://localhost:3000/fnd1.jpg" alt="">
                        <p>Hi, I am Ayushman Singh, a Computer Science Engineering student at NIT Surat. I am passionate about web development, competitive programming and DSA. I enjoy exploring new technologies, solving real world problems, and continuously improving my technical skills.</p>
                        <p>Let's connect and create something impactful !</p>
                        <div class="social">
                            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ayushman_2704/"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ayushmansingh27/"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                            <a href="mailto:singhayushman291@gmail.com"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>
                </div>
                <div id="jenil" class="founders">
                    <fieldset>
                        <legend><b>Jenil Prajapati</b></legend>
                        <img src="http://localhost:3000/fnd2.jpg" alt="">
                        <p>Hey there, I'm Jenil Prajapati, an enthusiastic Computer Science Engineering undergrad at NIT Surat. I'm passionate about full-stack development, DSA, and building tech solutions that make a difference. I believe technology should simplify life, and I love being a part of that change.</p>
                        <p>Dream big, build bigger !</p>
                        <div class="social">
                            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jenil_prajapati_nit/"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jenil-prajapati-b31505307/"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                            <a href="mailto:jenilp2146@gmail.com"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>
                </div>
                <div id="vineet" class="founders">
                    <fieldset>
                        <legend><b>Vineet Gupta</b></legend>
                        <img src="http://localhost:3000/fnd3.jpg" alt="">
                        <p>Hello, I'm Vineet Gupta, a Computer Science Engineering student at NIT Surat. I have a keen interest in competitive programming, web development, and data structures and algorithms. I thrive on challenges that test my problem-solving skills and push me to think creatively.</p>
                        <p>Always curious, always learning !</p>
                        <div class="social">
                            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/vineetg123?igsh=MTZ6aDl1Mjk0NTR6Ng=="><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vineet-gupta-431396272/"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                            <a href="mailto:guptavineet400@gmail.com"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            <!-- sidebar -->
            <div class="sidebar">
                <img src=<%= user.profile %> alt="Profile image" id="pfp">
                <p><b>Username : &MediumSpace;</b><%= user.username %></p>
                <p><b>Name : &MediumSpace;</b><%= user.name %></p>
                <button id="theme-toggle">
                    <i id="theme-icon" class="fa-solid fa-sun"></i>
                </button>

                <button id="edit">Edit Profile</button>
                <button  class = "premium"><a href="http://localhost:3000/<%= user._id %>/premium">PREMIUM</a></button>
                <form method="GET" action="http://localhost:3000/login">
                    <button>LOG OUT</button>
                </form>
            </div> 
        </div>
        <div id="profile" class="profile">
            <h1>Choose your Avatar!</h1>
            <button id="cross">&#10006;</button>
            <form method="POST" action="/users/<%= user._id %>?_method=PATCH">
                <div>
                    <input type="radio" id="img1" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a1.png">
                    <label for="img1"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a1.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                
                    <input type="radio" id="img2" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a2.png">
                    <label for="img2"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a2.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                
                    <input type="radio" id="img3" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a3.png">
                    <label for="img3"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a3.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                
                    <input type="radio" id="img4" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a4.png">
                    <label for="img4"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a4.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                
                    <input type="radio" id="img5" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a5.png">
                    <label for="img5"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a5.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                
                    <input type="radio" id="img6" name="img" value="http://localhost:3000/a6.png">
                    <label for="img6"><img src="http://localhost:3000/a6.png" alt="avatar"></label>
                </div>
                <br><br><br>
                <label for="name"><b>Enter name :</b></label>
                <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Enter name" name="name" value=<%= user.name %>>
                <button id="submit">SUBMIT</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    <script src="/home.js"></script>
</body>
</html>